#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:3
#: 8519b02584cb45e0bae11e5e90d55358
msgid "Rally Points"
msgstr "集结点"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:5
#: 79fb096b900c41a5b9cfd29260c96ed6
msgid ""
"Rally points are a list of home points for the APM. On entering a failsafe "
"mode (and the parameters are set to return home) the autopilot will fly the "
"UAV to the nearest rally point. Note that a maximum of 5 rally points are "
"supported per autopilot."
msgstr ""
"集结点是APM的一组起始返回点。进入失控保护模式时（且参数设置为返回起始点），飞控将引导无人机飞往最近的集结点。注意每个飞控最多支持5个集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:10
#: 38c8f8cf619042739644cf42696a3a79
msgid ""
"This is useful during long range flights, where it would be safer for the "
"UAV to return to a closer home point rather than flying all the way back to "
"the original home point."
msgstr "这在长距离飞行中非常有用——让无人机返回较近的起始点比飞回原始起始点更为安全。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:14
#: d35142daff9a4efdad411819d68d5b86
msgid "A rally menu is available on the GUI console."
msgstr "GUI控制台上提供集结点菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:17
#: 521e0fd8786a4ebeb3598de6ad23a5d2
msgid "rally list"
msgstr "rally list"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:19
#: d7da5b5614fe45f48f3c55e658de3a40
msgid "View the currently loaded rally points on the autopilot."
msgstr "查看飞控上当前加载的集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:22
#: 55c57295e1bf4b7482cca4cd58025628
msgid "rally load"
msgstr "rally load"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:24
#: fcafee6b89dd4e70b792b0d7f9739e01
msgid "Load a new set of rally points from file."
msgstr "从文件加载新的集结点集合。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:31
#: afca0a2b901e434287db8cf40918e66f
msgid "rally save"
msgstr "rally save"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:33
#: fe8b6457c35940cc8968e1474a96b3a2
msgid "Save the set of current rally points to file."
msgstr "将当前集结点集合保存到文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:40
#: 4f61adbc6ec5423cb44b9d3473294ed7
msgid "rally clear"
msgstr "rally clear"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:42
#: 6e98c9b0f8594d18a9469a6d111b6e39
msgid "Delete the rally points from the autopilot."
msgstr "从飞控中删除所有集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:45
#: b2d875d4e3ed4dac926aed086abcbcdd
msgid "rally move"
msgstr "rally move"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:47
#: 99a929ce71c549b0abfa2618ff4ba7f9
msgid ""
"Move a specific rally point to a new location. When entered, a new location "
"can be selected on the map window. This requires the map module to be "
"loaded."
msgstr "将特定集结点移动到新位置。输入命令后，可在地图窗口中选择新位置。此操作需要加载地图模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:56
#: e9657d1de70345599a3474ea70eba8aa
msgid "rally add"
msgstr "rally add"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:58
#: 71e95eb22ffa4047a2f8a4dc5266b506
msgid ""
"Add a new rally point. When entered, a location can be selected on the map "
"window. This requires the map module to be loaded."
msgstr "添加新集结点。输入命令后，可在地图窗口中选择位置。此操作需要加载地图模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:62
#: f7b5f80d41c848adae6374c99a0f1201
