msgstr "rally remove"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:64
#: d20fdaa073ee49cfb5420656b63f21d8
msgid "Remove a specific rally point."
msgstr "删除特定集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:71
#: 3a1a513794ab490382a9680999448164
msgid "rally land"
msgstr "rally land"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/rally.rst:73
#: 479f86d332ff44cb92f83d171214f3d1
msgid ""
"Command the autopilot to land from a rally point. See `this DIYDrones "
"article <http://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/landing-from-rally-points>`_ "
"for full details."
msgstr ""
"命令飞控从集结点降落。详情请参见 `此篇DIYDrones文章 "
"<http://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/landing-from-rally-points>`_。"
